# head/adult/man/wince_round: a round or square man's wince: the cheeks bunch up lit and the mouth gapes
# P2b FACES (wave 2), over the generic hurt face (expr, z 2). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body man
role head round
role head square
layer face
anchor head
keys expr
z 3
tags overlay mirror-ok

view D key hurt origin -3 -12
